WEBVTT

01:28.610 --> 01:35.270
Our Secret
EP22

01:37.890 --> 01:38.840
I'm back.

01:39.200 --> 01:40.290
Finally.

01:40.610 --> 01:41.800
Your computer has been ringing for a day.

01:42.369 --> 01:43.690
Come and see!

01:47.970 --> 01:48.890
Let me take a look.

02:02.520 --> 02:03.690
I see.

02:08.400 --> 02:09.440
Have a try.

02:10.330 --> 02:13.640
Wow, Childe Zhou has even learned how to cook.

02:14.330 --> 02:17.969
Too bad I could only have instant noodles in high school.

02:18.330 --> 02:19.360
Eat or not?

02:19.560 --> 02:20.330
Sure.

02:23.690 --> 02:24.640
This one.

02:31.969 --> 02:32.719
Is it good?

02:32.719 --> 02:33.440
Nice.

02:34.969 --> 02:36.210
So much better than before!

02:36.640 --> 02:37.770
How did you do that?

02:38.360 --> 02:39.690
When my dad was in hospital,

02:39.920 --> 02:42.050
I cooked for him.

02:45.050 --> 02:48.130
How is he now?

02:51.050 --> 02:54.440
He's fine, except that his heart has a little problem.

02:55.440 --> 02:56.969
Thanks to timely discovery,

02:57.330 --> 02:58.280
the treatment

02:58.520 --> 03:00.560
was effective.

03:02.160 --> 03:03.000
Good then.

03:03.430 --> 03:04.310
Continue.

03:04.310 --> 03:05.110
Oh, right.

03:08.250 --> 03:09.850
Here are your five hundred thousand yuan.

03:12.080 --> 03:13.560
Where did you get it?

03:13.770 --> 03:14.920
Is it my turn?

03:15.160 --> 03:16.560
I'd like to hear your answer first.

03:17.440 --> 03:19.560
Where did you get five hundred thousand?

03:21.080 --> 03:22.080
I...

03:22.800 --> 03:23.920
I sold the patent of robots

03:24.130 --> 03:25.110
that won me a prize.

03:25.490 --> 03:26.410
You sold it?

03:27.719 --> 03:29.800
You worked so hard for it.

03:30.800 --> 03:32.800
What are you going to do in the future?

03:33.410 --> 03:35.130
Future?

03:35.330 --> 03:36.890
I can invent another one in the future.

03:41.440 --> 03:43.560
You still haven't told me your answer.

03:47.250 --> 03:49.250
I explained

03:49.440 --> 03:51.560
all details on my Vlog.

03:52.000 --> 03:53.800
And many painters came to me

03:53.969 --> 03:56.640
saying they were cheated by Dream Journey Press.

03:57.160 --> 03:58.000
Then,

03:58.440 --> 04:00.770
we informed against this company jointly.

04:01.050 --> 04:02.920
And it was under investigation.

04:03.920 --> 04:05.000
Great!

04:07.360 --> 04:08.800
I have another good news.

04:10.160 --> 04:11.330
The author of "Shadows"

04:11.520 --> 04:13.280
loves my comics very much.

04:13.520 --> 04:15.160
He decided to give me his copyright,

04:15.330 --> 04:17.000
so that I could continue to make adaptions.

04:17.159 --> 04:19.210
He even signed a profit share contract with me.

04:19.770 --> 04:22.440
I can draw my original comics in the future.

04:23.210 --> 04:25.650
Do you think it's good to

04:25.890 --> 04:27.630
draw our stories in comics?

04:28.720 --> 04:29.840
What do you think?

04:31.400 --> 04:32.530
What do you think?

04:36.370 --> 04:37.240
What are you doing?

04:37.560 --> 04:38.560
Do you think

04:38.890 --> 04:40.370
I talk too much?

04:40.770 --> 04:43.120
No, you're cute.

04:46.330 --> 04:47.680
Why are you laughing?

05:03.890 --> 05:05.370
You still keep it.

05:08.530 --> 05:09.490
So, have you

05:11.330 --> 05:13.050
seen everything?

05:14.120 --> 05:15.050
Have I seen what?

05:17.280 --> 05:19.280
The secret diary.

05:21.490 --> 05:23.490
Didn't you mean to let me notice it?

05:24.330 --> 05:26.610
20121221

05:31.650 --> 05:32.680
But,

05:33.650 --> 05:35.840
I always wonder.

05:44.120 --> 05:45.930
Hello, I'm April.

05:47.680 --> 05:49.210
I'm so tired, April.

05:58.160 --> 05:59.240
What's this?

06:01.680 --> 06:03.090
So you've found it already.

06:04.330 --> 06:05.690
You told me

06:06.210 --> 06:08.280
that you wanted a star shining forever.

06:11.530 --> 06:12.440
When

06:13.160 --> 06:14.960
did I say that?

06:17.610 --> 06:18.650
You don't remember?

06:22.370 --> 06:23.960
I want to have

06:24.840 --> 06:26.810
a star that will never dim.

06:29.240 --> 06:30.840
That's a big dream.

06:34.210 --> 06:35.280
So,

06:36.400 --> 06:38.680
from that moment, you...

06:38.890 --> 06:40.160
What?

06:40.560 --> 06:41.530
How is that possible?

06:44.330 --> 06:46.240
I made this to encourage you in case that

06:46.610 --> 06:47.960
you might be tired in the repeating grade.

06:49.810 --> 06:51.770
Looks like it worked.

06:58.720 --> 07:02.370
I'm so tired, Siyue.

07:14.790 --> 07:16.530
Zhou Siyue.

07:17.050 --> 07:18.050
Tell me,

07:18.240 --> 07:20.650
when did you start to like me?

07:22.610 --> 07:24.160
Tell me. I wanna know.

07:24.680 --> 07:26.210
It's a secret.

07:28.400 --> 07:29.210
Your phone.

07:39.720 --> 07:41.000
Hey, mom.

07:41.210 --> 07:43.400
Xianxian, you winter vacation is coming, right?

07:43.650 --> 07:44.890
When will you come back?

07:47.280 --> 07:49.000
I'll be back in two or three days.

08:08.490 --> 08:09.440
Dad, mom,

08:09.720 --> 08:10.680
I'm back.

08:11.490 --> 08:12.810
Xianxian, it's good to have you back.

08:14.530 --> 08:15.370
Good to see you, uncle.

08:16.720 --> 08:17.530
Siyue.

08:18.000 --> 08:19.000
Good to see you.

08:20.440 --> 08:21.960
Thank you for bringing presents.

08:22.050 --> 08:23.240
Wanxian, come on. Siyue.

08:23.240 --> 08:23.810
Good to see you, aunt.

08:24.050 --> 08:25.696
I haven't see you for over one year.

08:25.720 --> 08:26.560
And you've become slenderer.

08:28.000 --> 08:29.210
You need to eat more today.

08:30.330 --> 08:32.680
Why do you two...

08:33.090 --> 08:34.559
Ding Xian said she would come back for the Spring Festival.

08:34.970 --> 08:37.210
I wanted come back too, so we came together.

08:37.530 --> 08:38.480
It's nice to have you two back together.

08:38.679 --> 08:39.730
Come on in.

08:40.530 --> 08:42.679
How's your father now?

08:43.040 --> 08:45.120
He's still under medical observation.

08:45.330 --> 08:46.530
In Jiangling.

08:46.800 --> 08:47.680
Okay.

08:47.970 --> 08:48.770
Wash your hands and let's have lunch.

08:49.000 --> 08:50.680
Have more cups of drink with me this time.

08:51.890 --> 08:53.090
You don't need to change shoes.

08:53.530 --> 08:55.040
Wine. I have good wine here.

08:57.730 --> 08:58.530
Go wash your hands.

09:03.600 --> 09:04.530
Come on, Siyue, take a seat.

09:04.730 --> 09:06.000
So many kinds of dishes.

09:06.330 --> 09:08.210
No, you're the guest, take your seat.

09:08.770 --> 09:09.730
Take it.

09:12.290 --> 09:14.800
You seem happier to see him than see me.

09:15.170 --> 09:15.970
Of course.

09:16.290 --> 09:18.170
Siyue is such an excellent kid.

09:18.600 --> 09:19.920
He was recommended to Huaqing University

09:20.290 --> 09:21.330
with decent personality.

09:21.730 --> 09:23.360
Everyone will be happy to meet him.

09:24.600 --> 09:25.970
This is my collected wine.

09:26.170 --> 09:27.530
Let's have some cups later.

09:28.240 --> 09:29.440
Just sit down. Ding Juncong.

09:30.240 --> 09:31.170
Lunch is ready.

09:31.650 --> 09:33.730
I'm not hungry. You go first.

09:35.000 --> 09:37.110
Don't you want to see your sister?

09:37.730 --> 09:38.480
I'm telling you,

09:38.480 --> 09:39.440
Ding Juncong

09:39.650 --> 09:41.090
is in puberty, a rebellious period.

09:41.240 --> 09:42.360
Just ignore him.

09:42.530 --> 09:43.480
All because you spoil him.

09:48.360 --> 09:51.600
Siyue, you're Xianxian's senior.

09:52.040 --> 09:53.360
On campus,

09:54.120 --> 09:56.090
please take more care of her.

09:56.920 --> 09:59.680
Of course, I'll take good care of her.

10:00.730 --> 10:02.680
And remember to watch out for her.

10:03.000 --> 10:04.040
She will indulge herself

10:04.440 --> 10:06.970
if no one is supervising her.

10:07.170 --> 10:08.000
I won't.

10:08.360 --> 10:09.680
I hope so.

10:10.240 --> 10:11.680
If I know that

10:11.970 --> 10:14.970
all you know is pleasure and dating,

10:15.170 --> 10:18.000
after spending so much effort to go to Huaqing University,

10:18.360 --> 10:19.410
You will get your lessons.

10:24.890 --> 10:25.600
Mom,

10:26.120 --> 10:27.360
I'm an adult now.

10:27.730 --> 10:29.410
Why can't I date?

10:29.560 --> 10:30.440
No, you can't.

10:30.800 --> 10:31.970
Such a waste of time！

10:32.170 --> 10:33.170
Enough, enough.

10:33.330 --> 10:34.770
Don't nag anymore.

10:35.000 --> 10:38.120
She's old enough to date anyone. Don't interfere.

10:38.290 --> 10:39.730
She's my daughter no matter how old she is.

10:39.970 --> 10:40.650
I have the right.

10:40.800 --> 10:41.600
Okay, okay.

10:41.650 --> 10:42.770
Don't mind them.

10:42.920 --> 10:43.800
Let's drink our wine.

10:43.970 --> 10:44.800
Come on, Siyue.

10:44.890 --> 10:45.560
Welcome.

10:45.560 --> 10:46.680
Thank you, uncle.

10:55.120 --> 10:55.800
Siyue.

10:56.040 --> 10:57.600
Leave it for me. You are guest.

10:59.120 --> 10:59.890
It's fine, aunt.

11:00.480 --> 11:01.970
I often wash dishes at home.

11:02.170 --> 11:03.170
Let me do it.

11:04.600 --> 11:05.600
It's fine, really.

11:06.480 --> 11:08.970
Mom, just drop it. I'll do it.

11:11.040 --> 11:12.040
Can I trust you two?

11:12.600 --> 11:14.530
Don't worry, aunt. We can handle this.

11:15.920 --> 11:17.000
Come on.

11:17.210 --> 11:18.920
Let the kids do it.

11:19.090 --> 11:20.040
Let's go.

11:20.210 --> 11:21.850
Find something else to do if you are terribly bored.

11:33.600 --> 11:34.600
What?

11:34.920 --> 11:36.240
Aren't you worried?

11:39.600 --> 11:40.440
Why don't we

11:41.680 --> 11:43.000
just tell them?

11:44.170 --> 11:44.970
No.

11:45.730 --> 11:47.920
What if my mom beats me?

11:48.120 --> 11:49.360
Then I'll stand in front of you,

11:49.730 --> 11:50.770
so she can only beat me.

11:51.650 --> 11:54.360
What if she makes me break up with you?

11:55.040 --> 11:56.480
Then I'll beg her,

11:57.920 --> 12:00.000
until she agrees.

12:01.530 --> 12:03.560
What if she doesn't want me to go home anymore?

12:05.560 --> 12:06.410
Then,

12:06.730 --> 12:08.480
she won't let me enter the house either.

12:09.730 --> 12:11.600
No, forget it.

12:14.290 --> 12:15.330
You will leave

12:17.120 --> 12:18.530
in two or three days.

12:19.600 --> 12:21.730
And I'll have to face them all by myself.

12:24.770 --> 12:25.650
Tell me!

12:26.560 --> 12:28.170
Who is the "sweetheart" in your contact list?

12:34.170 --> 12:35.440
Ouch, ouch.

12:36.210 --> 12:37.000
Tell me.

12:37.850 --> 12:39.000
Who is the "sweetheart"?

12:41.530 --> 12:42.410
Tell me.

12:43.000 --> 12:44.440
Who is the "sweetheart"?

12:45.650 --> 12:47.090
I can't believe it.

12:47.240 --> 12:48.480
You are in great trouble.

12:49.330 --> 12:50.290
Where is my feather duster?

12:50.890 --> 12:52.000
-Don't, mom. -Move away.

12:52.850 --> 12:53.650
Help me.

12:55.600 --> 12:57.330
Pray for yourself.

12:57.730 --> 12:58.970
Sweetheart.

13:00.850 --> 13:01.650
Brother-in-law,

13:02.890 --> 13:04.560
Please help me!

13:05.410 --> 13:06.330
What did you call me?

13:06.800 --> 13:07.800
Brother-in-law.

13:10.330 --> 13:12.000
You're a clever boy.

13:13.730 --> 13:14.600
Go, go, stop her.

13:14.600 --> 13:15.600
-Move away. -Mom.

13:15.600 --> 13:16.360
Got out of the way, Siyue.

13:16.360 --> 13:16.920
Aunt.

13:16.920 --> 13:17.440
Alright, stop.

13:17.440 --> 13:18.560
-Siyue, get out of the way. -Please calm down.

13:18.830 --> 13:19.440
Get out of the way, Siyue.

13:19.500 --> 13:21.170
I must teach him a lesson, or he won't learn.

13:21.170 --> 13:21.970
Don't beat him. You don't have to beat him.

13:21.970 --> 13:22.650
What are you doing?

13:22.920 --> 13:24.360
He deserves it, aunt.

13:27.240 --> 13:28.090
But,

13:28.800 --> 13:30.680
you can't have an answer even if you beat him.

13:34.890 --> 13:36.290
Ding Juncong,

13:36.290 --> 13:38.440
you're lucky that there's a guest. I'll let it go this time.

13:38.530 --> 13:39.440
Wait and see.

13:40.360 --> 13:41.330
Calm down, aunt.

13:42.730 --> 13:43.850
He's in puberty.

13:49.970 --> 13:52.970
This is so irritating.

13:55.170 --> 13:56.090
Siyue.

13:58.730 --> 13:59.170
Can you...

13:59.210 --> 14:00.000
No problem, aunt.

14:00.680 --> 14:02.360
I'm free recently.

14:02.650 --> 14:03.970
I can help Juncong

14:04.360 --> 14:05.210
with his lessons.

14:05.290 --> 14:06.210
And help you watch him.

14:06.680 --> 14:09.090
Siyue is so considerate.

14:11.000 --> 14:12.040
I wonder

14:12.090 --> 14:14.090
who will have the bliss to marry him.

14:21.210 --> 14:22.480
Who is the "sweetheart"?

14:23.560 --> 14:24.440
Is the one with a claw braid

14:24.600 --> 14:25.730
or the one in a short skirt?

14:25.890 --> 14:27.240
What are you doing, Ding Xian?

14:29.560 --> 14:30.850
Brat,

14:33.560 --> 14:35.530
mind your manners.

14:36.800 --> 14:37.850
Do your homework.

14:41.120 --> 14:42.000
I got it.

14:46.890 --> 14:48.890
There is something wrong between you two.

14:50.730 --> 14:52.240
Just focus on your homework.

14:53.850 --> 14:55.290
You two were dating in high school.

14:55.480 --> 14:56.360
How can you blame me?

14:56.650 --> 14:58.210
Who said we were dating in high school?

14:59.120 --> 15:00.090
We weren't.

15:00.890 --> 15:02.360
She has a crush on me, that's all.

15:05.800 --> 15:07.330
Didn't you have a crush on me too?

15:07.730 --> 15:09.090
You two are lame.

15:10.040 --> 15:11.210
It's none of your business.

15:11.970 --> 15:13.360
Solve your problems first.

15:13.360 --> 15:14.800
Who is that sweetheart?

15:15.800 --> 15:17.560
It's not what you think.

15:17.970 --> 15:19.000
You two are so bad.

15:19.360 --> 15:20.560
I'll report your thing to mom.

15:21.240 --> 15:22.170
Sit down.

15:22.480 --> 15:23.440
Don't tell mom.

15:24.040 --> 15:25.600
You're dead if you tell her.

15:26.000 --> 15:27.170
You're bullying me.

15:27.970 --> 15:29.530
That's only the start.

15:29.920 --> 15:32.290
Take out your homework. I'll teach you.

15:34.890 --> 15:36.680
Please teach him well then.

15:36.770 --> 15:38.210
It causes me headache to look at his homework.

15:38.410 --> 15:39.120
Concentrate on it.

15:42.270 --> 15:43.270
Come on, buddy.

15:56.800 --> 15:59.770
I don't want to do my homework, brother-in-law.

16:00.240 --> 16:02.530
I'm hungry.

16:02.800 --> 16:04.360
I want to eat something.

16:07.240 --> 16:08.730
What did you call me?

16:09.120 --> 16:10.120
Brother-in-law.

16:13.970 --> 16:15.330
Don't eat so much, stop.

16:19.170 --> 16:20.120
That's enough.

16:20.440 --> 16:22.000
It's fine. Go on.

16:26.000 --> 16:27.410
You're spoiling him.

16:28.040 --> 16:29.650
He doesn't eat any dishes at home,

16:29.910 --> 16:31.030
except some snacks.

16:34.730 --> 16:35.650
What's wrong with it?

16:36.330 --> 16:38.770
You had plenty of snacks in high school.

16:39.120 --> 16:40.440
You want some for yourself, right?

16:41.650 --> 16:43.440
Come on, try it.

16:50.210 --> 16:51.090
What are you two doing?

16:51.890 --> 16:53.120
Don't just focus on your snacks.

16:53.850 --> 16:55.440
You need to finish that test paper too.

16:56.170 --> 16:57.680
I'll give you explanation on your problems.

17:18.840 --> 17:21.600
Where do you live tonight?

17:23.239 --> 17:24.200
Your place.

17:25.170 --> 17:28.170
No, what if my mom finds out?

17:29.480 --> 17:31.000
Why don't you just tell her?

17:31.840 --> 17:32.970
Do your homework.

17:33.320 --> 17:35.130
Don't listen to adults' conversation.

17:41.600 --> 17:42.530
Then

17:44.120 --> 17:46.290
you'll have to go to my place.

17:49.050 --> 17:49.840
Your place?

17:54.320 --> 17:55.240
Let's do it.

17:58.050 --> 17:59.810
How long will it take to clean it up?

18:00.720 --> 18:01.840
I remember I have some unfinished business at home.

18:01.890 --> 18:02.810
I gotta go now.

18:09.570 --> 18:10.930
You've entered my home.

18:11.840 --> 18:13.570
Do you think you can leave so easily?

18:13.960 --> 18:15.810
I haven't entered yet.

18:17.650 --> 18:18.450
I haven't.

18:19.770 --> 18:20.550
Siyue.

18:25.050 --> 18:26.450
I'm bringing you quilts.

18:27.720 --> 18:28.770
Thank you, aunt.

18:28.890 --> 18:30.240
I remember

18:30.450 --> 18:32.080
your house hasn't been cleaned for a long time,

18:32.120 --> 18:34.000
so you could use it when you sleep.

18:35.200 --> 18:36.410
Why are you flushing?

18:41.120 --> 18:42.810
It's hot here, mom.

18:43.170 --> 18:44.120
Don't you think?

18:44.360 --> 18:45.200
It's hot indeed.

18:45.200 --> 18:46.530
You wear too much.

18:47.170 --> 18:48.650
Siyue,

18:49.080 --> 18:50.840
if you feel uncomfortable at night,

18:51.050 --> 18:52.690
come and sleep in our house.

18:52.690 --> 18:53.960
You can sleep in Juncong's room.

18:54.480 --> 18:55.650
There's no need, aunt.

18:55.930 --> 18:57.170
I can sleep here.

18:57.410 --> 18:58.320
It's fine.

18:58.570 --> 18:59.360
Okay.

18:59.450 --> 19:00.840
Tomorrow morning,

19:00.840 --> 19:02.360
come and have breakfast at our place.

19:02.600 --> 19:04.170
You like golden cakes, don't you?

19:04.360 --> 19:05.200
I'll make them for you.

19:05.290 --> 19:05.960
Okay.

19:07.200 --> 19:08.050
Are you leaving with me or not?

19:09.120 --> 19:10.120
Yes, yes.

19:24.360 --> 19:25.410
Something is wrong.

19:31.770 --> 19:33.170
So wrong.

19:42.410 --> 19:44.530
Do you feel that something is wrong

19:45.600 --> 19:46.600
between Xianxian and Siyue?

19:47.930 --> 19:49.720
I think there's something wrong with you.

19:50.600 --> 19:52.570
What? I'm enjoying it.

19:56.170 --> 19:57.200
I must ask them.

19:58.810 --> 19:59.690
Ding Juncong.

20:00.080 --> 20:01.000
Come here.

20:07.480 --> 20:09.080
Do you know anything?

20:11.050 --> 20:11.930
I...

20:12.480 --> 20:13.480
I don't know.

20:14.200 --> 20:16.200
Don't give him a hard time.

20:16.360 --> 20:17.720
Why are you so inquisitive?

20:17.930 --> 20:19.200
What do you want?

20:19.930 --> 20:21.890
You can go to sleep if you have nothing else to do.

20:22.050 --> 20:23.000
Don't be such a stickybeak.

20:24.320 --> 20:25.200
Tell me,

20:25.810 --> 20:27.200
what do you know?

20:29.930 --> 20:30.890
Ding Juncong,

20:31.410 --> 20:33.570
whenever you lie, you stare at the floor.

20:33.720 --> 20:34.480
Tell me.

20:35.410 --> 20:36.930
Alright, I can tell you.

20:37.120 --> 20:38.080
But give my phone back.

20:47.570 --> 20:48.960
I'm sorry, brother-in-law.

20:49.770 --> 20:50.890
Zhou Siyue

20:51.080 --> 20:52.600
is her sweetheart.

21:01.170 --> 21:02.170
I'm going to bed.

21:16.600 --> 21:17.410
Xianxian.

21:17.840 --> 21:18.610
Dad.

21:20.290 --> 21:21.650
Don't stare at your phone.

21:21.840 --> 21:22.930
Your eyesight is failing.

21:27.240 --> 21:28.290
Who are you texting?

21:29.450 --> 21:30.320
Nobody.

21:33.890 --> 21:35.360
Being young is so great.

21:37.720 --> 21:38.720
I think so.

21:39.450 --> 21:41.930
It reminds me of the days when your mom and I were young.

21:42.570 --> 21:44.450
We had so much to say to each other.

21:44.840 --> 21:46.930
And even a little thing could make us so happy.

21:48.290 --> 21:49.170
Me too.

21:50.410 --> 21:52.320
Just seeing him can make me happy.

21:57.690 --> 21:58.600
Dad,

21:58.890 --> 22:00.570
how could you scam secret out of me like that?

22:01.080 --> 22:02.360
I did not.

22:02.930 --> 22:04.000
I've long known

22:04.200 --> 22:05.240
your little secret.

22:06.050 --> 22:08.200
You're texting Siyue, aren't you?

22:08.930 --> 22:10.170
I'm 21 now.

22:10.480 --> 22:11.840
I can have a relationship.

22:14.290 --> 22:16.320
I'm here to tell you,

22:16.720 --> 22:18.720
I watched Siyue grow up,

22:19.170 --> 22:21.290
and I'm glad to see you two being together.

22:23.720 --> 22:24.690
Thank you, dad.

22:25.000 --> 22:26.200
You understand me.

22:28.530 --> 22:29.450
But,

22:29.840 --> 22:32.960
if your mom does something to you,

22:33.170 --> 22:34.080
don't be mad.

22:34.690 --> 22:37.000
You know her. She loves being a stickybeak.

22:38.000 --> 22:39.810
Why would she be mad?

22:41.840 --> 22:43.600
Alright, sleep early.

23:09.770 --> 23:10.600
Drink them.

23:13.930 --> 23:14.810
Mom.

23:15.200 --> 23:17.320
You said you were going to make golden cakes.

23:17.720 --> 23:19.690
Congee is good enough for you.

23:25.690 --> 23:27.120
Congee is good.

23:36.530 --> 23:37.360
Siyue.

23:37.960 --> 23:38.770
Come on.

23:41.080 --> 23:42.170
Have more.

23:44.240 --> 23:45.930
You're still growing.

23:46.530 --> 23:47.890
And you're so thin.

23:49.080 --> 23:50.080
Thank you, aunt.

23:50.600 --> 23:51.810
Don't peek.

23:53.000 --> 23:53.930
You should also have more.

23:55.720 --> 23:58.570
I'm already full, mom.

24:00.530 --> 24:01.570
Well,

24:02.810 --> 24:03.810
I remember

24:04.200 --> 24:05.690
I must leave now for something important.

24:05.770 --> 24:07.320
It's Spring Festival. What is so urgent?

24:08.890 --> 24:09.890
School's affairs.

24:10.810 --> 24:12.240
I heard there is a student...

24:12.810 --> 24:13.480
Hello?

24:24.530 --> 24:26.080
How's the breakfast, brother-in-law?

24:30.890 --> 24:32.000
Mom has already known.

24:41.600 --> 24:43.650
When did it begin?

24:46.170 --> 24:46.960
Aunt.

24:47.930 --> 24:49.600
We weren't together until last month.

24:52.930 --> 24:54.930
You two kept it from me together.

24:56.200 --> 24:57.080
Is it funny?

25:01.840 --> 25:02.840
It's my fault, aunt.

25:04.170 --> 25:06.360
I should have taken care of her earlier.

25:07.570 --> 25:09.000
What have you done to my daughter?

25:09.530 --> 25:10.770
What are you talking about?

25:12.000 --> 25:12.840
No, aunt,

25:13.200 --> 25:14.200
don't take me wrong.

25:15.360 --> 25:16.810
I mean,

25:17.120 --> 25:18.240
I have been

25:19.000 --> 25:20.450
disappointing her for too long.

25:21.410 --> 25:23.410
So I'll do my best

25:23.600 --> 25:24.550
to offer her the best.

25:31.170 --> 25:34.360
Don't be angry, mom.

25:36.650 --> 25:37.690
I'm angry.

25:38.890 --> 25:40.450
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

25:42.000 --> 25:43.810
You told me that

25:44.000 --> 25:45.360
I couldn't date anyone.

25:46.200 --> 25:47.810
So I didn't tell you.

25:49.000 --> 25:51.320
But you didn't tell me it was Siyue.

25:52.000 --> 25:54.120
He is such a hard-working kid.

25:54.450 --> 25:55.530
If you learn from him,

25:55.690 --> 25:57.240
I will support you.

26:03.240 --> 26:04.120
Aunt,

26:05.200 --> 26:06.320
actually,

26:06.770 --> 26:08.570
I should thank Ding Xian.

26:09.690 --> 26:11.200
Without her,

26:12.410 --> 26:14.000
maybe I'll still

26:14.200 --> 26:15.410
live a depressing life.

26:19.840 --> 26:20.690
Siyue.

26:21.410 --> 26:23.360
It's nice that you and Xianxian can be happy.

26:25.200 --> 26:26.650
She's my only daughter.

26:30.240 --> 26:31.810
Please be nice to her.

26:35.050 --> 26:36.410
You like golden cakes, don't you?

26:36.930 --> 26:38.120
I've made for you.

26:38.480 --> 26:39.290
Wait.

26:52.480 --> 26:53.600
Are you still full?

26:55.200 --> 26:56.600
I feel that I don't need to eat anything

26:56.770 --> 26:57.720
in the next three days.

27:02.890 --> 27:04.570
You're leaving again.

27:05.410 --> 27:08.720
When can we spend Spring Festival together?

27:11.480 --> 27:13.810
Professor Ye has a new program,

27:15.080 --> 27:17.240
and I need to keep my parents' company.

27:19.770 --> 27:20.810
I understand.

27:21.410 --> 27:22.770
The proper business matters.

27:35.320 --> 27:36.450
Be cheerful.

27:46.360 --> 27:48.890
Alright, go home now.

27:49.530 --> 27:51.530
Or your parents will worry about you.

27:52.050 --> 27:53.960
I want to stay with you longer.

27:56.890 --> 27:57.810
No,

27:59.450 --> 28:01.240
or it will be too difficult for me to say goodbye.

28:02.290 --> 28:04.080
Then, give me a hug.

28:17.690 --> 28:18.480
Okay.

28:19.320 --> 28:20.720
We'll see each other soon.

28:21.530 --> 28:22.600
Hug me longer.

28:27.960 --> 28:29.050
Hold me tighter.

28:56.960 --> 28:57.960
The doctor said,

28:58.410 --> 29:00.770
your father is in unstable condition.

29:01.050 --> 29:02.530
Go and see him.

29:10.530 --> 29:11.930
I want to go home.

29:22.810 --> 29:23.840
When you've recovered,

29:24.770 --> 29:25.960
we can go home.

29:29.120 --> 29:30.240
Okay.

29:34.170 --> 29:35.240
I'm aging.

29:37.290 --> 29:40.000
Now I always recall the past.

29:40.930 --> 29:42.690
I remember when you were a kid,

29:44.000 --> 29:45.410
the art teacher

29:47.000 --> 29:49.480
asked you to make bookmarks.

29:50.170 --> 29:51.650
You didn't want to make them.

29:52.240 --> 29:55.690
So, you picked up a leaf on your way home.

30:00.450 --> 30:01.570
I remember it.

30:03.170 --> 30:05.320
Teacher praised me at that time.

30:06.080 --> 30:08.000
She said I was innovative.

30:08.690 --> 30:09.890
However,

30:11.530 --> 30:12.650
when I went back home,

30:12.650 --> 30:14.450
you scolded me.

30:16.200 --> 30:18.570
I rarely came back home,

30:20.000 --> 30:23.360
but still left you unpleasant memories.

30:30.120 --> 30:32.080
Actually, when I was little,

30:33.480 --> 30:35.410
I envied Song Ziqi.

30:39.050 --> 30:41.240
Whatever he did,

30:42.050 --> 30:43.690
his dad would be there for him,

30:45.000 --> 30:46.240
praised him

30:46.960 --> 30:48.200
and encouraged him.

30:49.770 --> 30:51.410
But when I was little,

30:53.200 --> 30:54.960
you were strict to me.

30:57.840 --> 30:59.450
You taught me that

30:59.930 --> 31:01.770
I need to take on every responsibility.

31:02.720 --> 31:05.770
Be excellent and independent.

31:08.570 --> 31:10.480
I didn't understand back then.

31:12.930 --> 31:15.360
So, I felt stressful,

31:17.080 --> 31:19.000
tired and hard.

31:26.200 --> 31:28.290
But now I understand it all.

31:29.360 --> 31:31.200
If I can be a little help

31:32.050 --> 31:35.120
for you and mom,

31:36.650 --> 31:37.960
I'll be happy.

31:49.360 --> 31:50.770
You wouldn't

31:51.810 --> 31:54.480
say these things to me before.

31:57.120 --> 31:59.480
You wouldn't listen to me, either.

32:02.530 --> 32:03.890
Brat.

32:48.810 --> 32:49.690
Hey, Shadi.

32:49.770 --> 32:50.530
Hey, Xianxian.

32:50.600 --> 32:51.840
Guess where we are.

32:52.480 --> 32:53.720
Where are you?

32:55.120 --> 32:55.960
Little Monster.

32:56.450 --> 32:57.890
When did you come back?

32:58.840 --> 33:00.000
Just today.

33:00.170 --> 33:01.930
I heard that Keke came back too.

33:01.930 --> 33:03.200
Come and hang out with us tomorrow.

33:03.770 --> 33:04.320
Okay.

33:04.600 --> 33:05.600
Which one do you want, Kong Shadi?

33:05.690 --> 33:06.650
This one or that one? I'll hang up.

33:06.890 --> 33:07.570
See you tomorrow.

33:16.570 --> 33:17.570
What are you doing recently?

33:17.570 --> 33:18.120
Enjoy.

33:18.120 --> 33:19.840
I'm busy thinking about you.

33:21.360 --> 33:23.310
Can you two stop whispering since we hang out for fun?

33:23.690 --> 33:25.320
You can go out if you have a problem.

33:25.810 --> 33:26.770
Alright, go on.

33:26.960 --> 33:28.080
I'll pick the songs.

33:30.320 --> 33:31.200
Keke!

33:32.810 --> 33:34.240
Jiang Chen?

33:34.480 --> 33:35.720
Why didn't you tell me earlier, brother?

33:35.890 --> 33:37.480
I thought you wouldn't come back for the festival.

33:37.650 --> 33:39.650
I wanted to surprise you.

33:40.290 --> 33:41.240
Where is Zhou Siyue?

33:41.570 --> 33:43.570
He went back to Jiangling to deal with somethings.

33:43.930 --> 33:44.720
Don't mind him.

33:44.960 --> 33:46.290
Today is our girls party.

33:46.650 --> 33:48.690
Then why did you bring your man here?

33:48.890 --> 33:49.770
Yeah.

33:49.930 --> 33:51.650
He insisted on coming here with me.

33:52.050 --> 33:53.170
And you're blaming me?

33:53.530 --> 33:54.770
You brought your man too.

33:55.650 --> 33:56.530
He is not my man.

33:56.960 --> 33:58.170
I feel insecure when I go back home at night.

33:58.410 --> 33:59.360
So, he's my bodyguard.

34:01.810 --> 34:02.720
Bodyguard.

34:03.170 --> 34:04.080
What's this?

34:04.120 --> 34:05.410
Did you get her or not?

34:06.570 --> 34:07.360
Don't mention it.

34:08.200 --> 34:09.080
We're in same situations.

34:09.690 --> 34:10.970
I'm not.

34:11.450 --> 34:13.799
I heard that Zhou Ziyue had met your parents.

34:14.450 --> 34:15.799
It's going pretty fast.

34:17.760 --> 34:19.210
He did.

34:19.760 --> 34:20.600
But,

34:21.120 --> 34:22.560
I don't think anything is in progress.

34:23.120 --> 34:24.010
What do you mean?

34:26.170 --> 34:29.170
It feels we are still acting like we were in high school.

34:29.690 --> 34:30.839
Nothing has changed.

34:31.319 --> 34:32.690
Where exactly are you now?

34:35.250 --> 34:36.520
We've held hands,

34:38.040 --> 34:39.250
and kissed.

34:43.319 --> 34:44.170
That's all?

34:47.410 --> 34:48.080
I understand.

34:48.930 --> 34:50.279
Does he still treat you as a kid?

34:52.359 --> 34:53.520
Maybe.

34:55.250 --> 34:56.690
Please be confident.

34:57.250 --> 34:58.730
He is treating you as a kid.

34:59.320 --> 35:00.120
You two

35:00.320 --> 35:01.690
are nothing like a couple.

35:10.320 --> 35:11.600
What took you so long?

35:12.080 --> 35:13.410
I just finished the things at the laboratory.

35:14.040 --> 35:15.080
Are you tired?

35:17.320 --> 35:18.170
Ding Xian.

35:18.760 --> 35:19.930
You must let him know

35:20.250 --> 35:21.650
that you're a girl.

35:22.040 --> 35:24.320
You need to tease him appropriately,

35:24.650 --> 35:26.280
so that he wants to protect you.

35:30.450 --> 35:32.080
Sweetheart,

35:34.120 --> 35:35.840
I feel cold.

35:40.040 --> 35:41.040
What's wrong?

35:42.080 --> 35:43.010
I'm cold.

35:47.080 --> 35:48.210
You don't have a fever.

35:50.760 --> 35:52.170
I've been waiting you for so long.

35:52.210 --> 35:54.280
Don't you think you should do something?

36:01.800 --> 36:02.600
Wait.

36:18.650 --> 36:20.490
Come on, it's still hot.

36:20.690 --> 36:22.170
Warm your hands with it.

36:25.360 --> 36:26.250
Do you feel better?

36:29.080 --> 36:30.890
Let's grab some food after we put away the luggage.

36:31.320 --> 36:33.040
Maybe not today.

36:33.800 --> 36:34.360
A project in the laboratory

36:34.410 --> 36:35.930
needs to be done soon.

36:37.800 --> 36:39.170
Let me walk you to the dormitory.

36:40.210 --> 36:40.930
Thanks.

36:41.360 --> 36:42.690
But I need to go shopping.

36:45.930 --> 36:47.080
Then I'm leaving now.

36:57.730 --> 36:58.520
Ding Xian.

36:58.890 --> 36:59.970
Are you really not going to have dinner?

37:01.450 --> 37:03.210
No, I don't have any appetite.

37:03.650 --> 37:04.600
Where's your boyfriend?

37:05.010 --> 37:06.010
You haven't seen him for a vacation.

37:06.450 --> 37:07.600
Don't you want to meet him?

37:09.490 --> 37:11.490
He stays in the laboratory all the time.

37:11.560 --> 37:12.600
I just met him,

37:12.970 --> 37:14.040
and he went back again.

37:14.840 --> 37:16.360
Is he so obsessed with academic research?

37:17.800 --> 37:18.730
Go ahead.

37:19.410 --> 37:20.650
We'll bring you snacks back.

37:21.080 --> 37:21.690
Go.

37:22.010 --> 37:22.890
We're leaving.

37:38.690 --> 37:39.490
I'm done.

37:39.650 --> 37:40.890
I'm downstairs at your dormitory.

37:47.040 --> 37:47.930
Studying?

37:49.840 --> 37:51.320
Are you serious?

37:51.730 --> 37:52.520
I heard that

37:53.120 --> 37:53.760
in this semester,

37:53.840 --> 37:55.410
Profess Wang's courses are troublesome.

37:55.760 --> 37:57.210
I can help you prepare for them.

37:58.490 --> 38:00.930
But I haven't had supper yet.

38:02.450 --> 38:04.010
I've prepared it for you.

38:09.930 --> 38:11.120
It's your favorite cake.

38:11.650 --> 38:13.120
There's plenty of them for your roommates too.

38:16.490 --> 38:19.360
But I want to have supper with you.

38:19.560 --> 38:21.120
No need, I've had it.

38:21.970 --> 38:23.490
Have you figured out

38:23.520 --> 38:24.490
the question I explained to you last time?

38:25.560 --> 38:26.520
This one.

38:27.760 --> 38:28.650
No.

38:30.890 --> 38:31.730
It's fine.

38:32.250 --> 38:33.600
I'll do it first,

38:33.840 --> 38:35.840
and think about this method.

38:38.250 --> 38:40.600
D, C.

38:43.930 --> 38:45.600
Professor Wang wants me to read a book,

38:45.840 --> 38:47.760
but I can't find where it is.

38:48.010 --> 38:48.520
What book?

38:48.520 --> 38:49.760
Come and look for it with me.

38:52.760 --> 38:53.520
What book?

38:56.890 --> 38:58.800
Where is it?

39:00.250 --> 39:01.210
What's the name?

39:06.650 --> 39:07.560
Is it here?

39:10.840 --> 39:11.930
I don't think so.

39:14.690 --> 39:15.650
Here?

39:45.010 --> 39:46.120
This one?

40:01.690 --> 40:02.800
I'm back.

40:04.280 --> 40:05.250
What's that?

40:06.280 --> 40:08.970
Zhou Siyue bought it. He wanted us to share.

40:09.410 --> 40:10.450
He's so sweet.

40:10.890 --> 40:12.520
Why do you look so depressed?

40:14.010 --> 40:16.080
It feels nothing has changed.

40:16.730 --> 40:17.650
Is it because

40:18.010 --> 40:19.690
you two are too familiar with each other?

40:20.210 --> 40:21.930
Maybe as time goes,

40:22.410 --> 40:24.360
you two don't feel fresh anymore.

40:24.840 --> 40:25.690
Really?

40:27.450 --> 40:28.800
What should I do then?

40:29.410 --> 40:30.410
I think

40:31.250 --> 40:32.600
you can change yourself.

40:32.800 --> 40:33.800
Change myself?

40:48.690 --> 40:49.520
Look.

40:51.210 --> 40:53.170
I barely recognize you, you know that?

40:53.250 --> 40:54.560
I thought it was our campus belle.

40:54.650 --> 40:55.250
Yeah.

40:56.730 --> 40:57.600
You want to find our boss?

40:58.650 --> 40:59.600
He just left.

41:00.520 --> 41:01.520
Then I'll go and find him.

41:01.730 --> 41:02.490
Okay, bye.

41:05.690 --> 41:07.320
I don't know why our boss is so lucky.

41:09.930 --> 41:10.690
Good then.

41:11.250 --> 41:12.170
Remember,

41:12.450 --> 41:14.930
if you have anything you don't understand,

41:15.010 --> 41:16.170
come and ask me.

41:20.320 --> 41:21.930
If you have any problems in academic research...

41:21.930 --> 41:22.890
Zhou Siyue!

41:25.800 --> 41:26.930
Do you miss me?

41:28.650 --> 41:30.040
I just saw you yesterday.

41:31.410 --> 41:33.690
You should still miss me today.

41:33.970 --> 41:35.170
Okay, I'm leaving.

41:35.490 --> 41:36.170
Okay.

41:41.930 --> 41:42.840
What's wrong?

41:43.490 --> 41:44.360
Are you mad?

41:45.410 --> 41:47.600
I know why you ignored me recently.

41:48.730 --> 41:50.360
Did I say yes too quickly?

41:52.320 --> 41:53.210
What is going on

41:53.250 --> 41:54.730
in your little head?

41:55.930 --> 41:56.890
That is

41:57.250 --> 41:58.840
our software engineering teacher.

41:59.210 --> 42:00.170
An elective subject.

42:00.730 --> 42:01.930
An elective subject?

42:03.560 --> 42:05.080
To get in her class,

42:05.280 --> 42:06.800
Yuan Fang secretly changed my class schedule.

42:07.210 --> 42:08.320
Why would I lie to you?

42:13.600 --> 42:15.120
Why do you dress like this?

42:19.410 --> 42:20.520
Is it pretty?

42:21.890 --> 42:22.760
Yes.

42:24.930 --> 42:29.210
But you might get arthritis dressing this way.

42:29.410 --> 42:30.360
It's cold recently.

42:31.040 --> 42:32.600
Wear pants next time.

42:32.930 --> 42:33.600
Okay?

42:33.930 --> 42:35.890
Why do you act like an old man?

42:37.650 --> 42:38.280
What?

42:40.080 --> 42:42.010
Did I say something wrong again?

42:47.210 --> 42:49.410
Do you still treat me like a kid?

42:49.970 --> 42:51.800
You always act like we were in high school.

42:52.040 --> 42:53.520
You help me with lessons and take care of me.

42:54.280 --> 42:56.520
But the relationship between us

42:56.560 --> 42:58.450
has changed.

42:59.840 --> 43:01.600
I want to stay with you every day.

43:01.840 --> 43:03.360
I want you to compliment my dress.

43:03.410 --> 43:05.170
And I want to hear you say you like me.

43:10.560 --> 43:11.450
I'm sorry.

43:13.730 --> 43:14.970
I'm too stupid.

43:16.490 --> 43:18.280
I misunderstood you every day,

43:19.890 --> 43:21.320
and ignored your feelings.

43:22.840 --> 43:24.210
But I won't do that anymore.

43:33.170 --> 43:34.360
I like you.

43:37.170 --> 43:38.520
I like you a lot.

43:43.890 --> 43:46.520
Then you know why I'm mad, don't you?

43:48.410 --> 43:49.600
I know.

43:55.210 --> 43:55.970
Come on.

43:56.280 --> 43:57.560
Let's have lunch together.

44:02.210 --> 44:02.800
Your cake.

44:02.800 --> 44:03.410
Thank you.

44:03.410 --> 44:04.010
You're welcome.

44:05.730 --> 44:06.250
Come on.

44:07.170 --> 44:08.930
Wait, I want to take a photo.

44:14.690 --> 44:15.320
Okay.

44:15.690 --> 44:16.320
Okay?

44:22.830 --> 44:23.510
Take this.

44:28.170 --> 44:28.840
Good?

44:37.250 --> 44:37.890
Look.

44:40.010 --> 44:40.610
Yeah.

45:19.450 --> 45:20.120
Here we are.

45:21.250 --> 45:23.010
Thank you for walking me here.

45:24.760 --> 45:25.520
Alright.

45:25.890 --> 45:26.730
Go up there.

45:28.120 --> 45:29.410
I want a hug.

45:52.250 --> 45:53.040
Okay.

45:53.690 --> 45:54.650
Go.

45:57.650 --> 45:58.890
I'll watch you leaving.

46:01.250 --> 46:02.360
I'll watch you going upstairs.

46:03.360 --> 46:04.560
You go first.

46:05.320 --> 46:06.930
Come on, listen to me.

46:08.120 --> 46:09.410
I'm leaving now.

46:30.040 --> 46:31.360
I can't.

46:33.360 --> 46:34.410
The door is locked.

46:44.690 --> 46:45.890
If you can't go back,

46:47.520 --> 46:49.360
you'll have to stay here for one night.

47:00.930 --> 47:01.970
Wear these.

47:17.250 --> 47:18.120
Take a seat.

47:19.040 --> 47:21.170
I'll get you cleaning items.
